OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAfter a dry
OL,6,Fbut cloudy evening, isolated showers
OL,7,Fdevelop overnight. Towards dawn an
OL,8,Forganised band of heavy, potentially
OL,9,Fthundery, showers crosses the area
OL,10,Finto Thursday morning. Mild and muggy
OL,11,Fovernight.
OL,12,
OL,13,CThursday:FA cloudy and wet start with
OL,14,Fheavy, potentially thundery showers
OL,15,Fmoving across the area. Showers clear
OL,16,Fthrough the morning to leave a fine
OL,17,Fand dry afternoon and evening. Feeling
OL,18,Fwarm.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
