OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FRemaining
OL,6,Funsettled into the weekend, widely
OL,7,Fcloudy with further rain and showers,
OL,8,Fpotentially heavy or thundery at
OL,9,Ftimes. Temperatures around average.
